3. `SLAYZONE_HOST` default — `127.0.0.1` (localhost-only) or `localhost` literal? Trusted-net warning when host != loopback — defer to Phase 3 banner per master §11b, or add stderr warning now?
4. CLI `SLAYZONE_DB_PATH` (file path) — different env var than `SLAYZONE_DB_DIR` (dir). Touch in Phase 0 or leave for CLI rework later?
5. `db/index.ts:65` `app.getPath('appData')` legacy migration — confirmed to skip (pre-rebrand path), correct?

